  "Possible Issues", "ExampleSection",ExpressionUUID->
   "0590a90f-b407-4558-8040-e061d278b144"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleSection",
 CellID->879324050,ExpressionUUID->"557ea2f0-b4e2-4ed6-a509-0c9021c9fda8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[Cell[
  "Per-site rescale convention", "ExampleSubsection",ExpressionUUID->
   "f081b4d3-f39f-42a4-95c1-b16b087d4582"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleSubsection",
 CellID->187369101,ExpressionUUID->"0cdbf764-cf1d-45c6-afcb-8eefd62e3ee2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Some MPS libraries concentrate the rescale on a single boundary tensor (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox["", "1"]}], "\[Rule]", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["", "1"], "/", 
     RowBox[{
      ButtonBox["MPSNorm",
       BaseStyle->"Link",
       ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/MPSNorm"], "[", 
      StyleBox["mps", "TI"], "]"}]}]}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "52f1b0fd-995e-4b37-a073-96fdfda830a8"],
 "). ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["MPSNormalize",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/MPSNormalize"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"83cf288c-a0a2-4386-99ad-de22df3d3a6f"],
 " divides every tensor by the per-site factor ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   RowBox[{
    ButtonBox["MPSNorm",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/MPSNorm"], "[", 
    StyleBox["mps", "TI"], "]"}], 
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "14d73879-deee-4a60-957d-caca26ac9955"],
 " instead. Both conventions produce the same physical state but the \
individual tensors differ:"
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->414369586,ExpressionUUID->"5b0beb58-d4b7-4797-b777-5b1c8f767572"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"mpsIssue", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "42", "]"}], ";", " ", 
    RowBox[{"RandomTensorNetwork", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<MPS\>\"", "[", 
      RowBox[{"6", ",", " ", "4", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->848971265,ExpressionUUID->"e3ac7dc8-930d-49a2-bdb2-11a8c7f0befb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
   RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"MPSNormalize", "[", "mpsIssue", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Tensors\>\"", 
      "]"}], "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "/", 
  RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
   RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"mpsIssue", "[", "\"\<Tensors\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:=",
 CellID->717432391,ExpressionUUID->"c31b667f-ca2e-4b18-90ac-4c6bc96b544b"],

Cell[BoxData["0.7023971287036509`"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]=",
 CellID->44443877,ExpressionUUID->"ad3c4865-dd0d-4d59-93bc-0e7da53b8bdc"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[Cell[
  "\t", "ExampleDelimiter",ExpressionUUID->
   "a16766b8-b081-4922-b687-dd9d95b60817"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleDelimiter",
 CellID->886136952,ExpressionUUID->"af989162-654c-49e0-834c-c75c74fb83cb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Under the single-boundary convention the first tensor would be scaled by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "/", 
   ButtonBox["MPSNorm",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/MPSNorm"], "[", 
   StyleBox["mps", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "cfe3e66a-21c1-4cc7-bd9e-f1936fee2968"],
 ". The two scalings differ by a factor that depends on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7423ad65-6104-4032-85f9-ade1efbcb224"],
 ":"
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->445009153,ExpressionUUID->"f33e5e3d-3d1c-41e3-ac74-acfe8c384ab6"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"1", "/", 
  RowBox[{"MPSNorm", "[", "mpsIssue", "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:=",
 CellID->594627803,ExpressionUUID->"2872552e-64b7-40f5-8041-ba90417c1e37"],

Cell[BoxData["0.12008710229605775`"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[3]=",
 CellID->367628999,ExpressionUUID->"c08cffa4-c28a-48ef-9ca3-03249af121c9"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[Cell[
  "Dynamic range and underflow", "ExampleSubsection",ExpressionUUID->
   "2c406407-f5ee-4ed2-b079-a0d5756502b6"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleSubsection",
 CellID->339917853,ExpressionUUID->"19bef565-94ae-484d-b316-8ffb3644ea25"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "When ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["MPSNorm",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/MPSNorm"], "[", 
   StyleBox["mps", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8aa6ccf7-b5ac-4eb7-a292-a228db1ce69c"],
 " is extremely large or small, the per-site factor ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   RowBox[{
    ButtonBox["MPSNorm",
     BaseStyle->"Link",
     ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/MPSNorm"], "[", 
    StyleBox["mps", "TI"], "]"}], 
   RowBox[{"1", "/", 
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]}]]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "fa9f20f5-63a8-4770-be70-541cec6a2d0d"],
 " may lie within the floating-point range even when scaling by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "/", 
   ButtonBox["MPSNorm",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/MPSNorm"], "[", 
   StyleBox["mps", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "f6a803bc-7704-4860-93ed-b4046134e8f7"],
 " on a single site would underflow. The per-site convention is therefore \
numerically gentler for long chains."
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->493106080,ExpressionUUID->"ef356f91-513d-4aaa-bc92-4436c53e6886"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

